WEBVTT

00:03:29.759 --> 00:03:31.409
into a single moment.

00:03:31.409 --> 00:03:32.939
In “The God’s Script,”

00:03:32.939 --> 00:03:35.249
at the very beginning of the world

00:03:35.249 --> 00:03:38.269
the god writes exactly one message

00:03:38.269 --> 00:03:40.429
into the spots of the jaguars,

00:03:40.429 --> 00:03:43.799
who then “love and reproduce without end,

00:03:43.799 --> 00:03:47.569
in caverns, in cane fields, on islands,

00:03:47.569 --> 00:03:51.619
in order that the last men 
might receive it.”

00:03:51.619 --> 00:03:55.459
The last man turns out to be a tenacious
old priest

00:03:55.459 --> 00:04:00.499
who spends years memorizing and 
deciphering the jaguar’s spots,